Local modifications (Rillby, formerly Watch Dot Voice; watch-dot-voice)

This copy is derived from https://github.com/Torcata/watch-dot at commit
0ca53cc050017533e5ed8aef0436fc32e20f2ba1. Changes:
- WatchDot.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj: signing team removed; bundle identifiers derived
  from WATCHDOT_BUNDLE_PREFIX in ../docs/config/WatchDot.xcconfig.
- User-facing text translated from Spanish to English, in 11 source files and 3 test
  files, as exact literal replacements listed in
  ../docs/translation/en-replacements.json. The timestamp month locale changed from
  es_ES to en_US_POSIX, covered by an added test. Authentication, transport, storage
  and protocol identifiers are unchanged.
- An avatar-first Watch home screen with voice input (the upstream text chat moves
  into an Options menu), recorded as one reviewed patch in
  ../docs/patches/avatar-voice/avatar-voice.patch and pinned by SHA256 in
  ../docs/patches/avatar-voice.json. Tapping the avatar records audio, which is sent
  with the existing ChatGPT sign-in to ChatGPT's dictation endpoint, and the
  transcript is sent through the existing message path. Includes a microphone
  usage description and a build number bump. No sprite artwork is included; see
  ../docs/custom-avatar.md.
- Rillby branding: app display names and visible copy, build 8, and complication revision 7.
  Technical identifiers are unchanged. The original Rillby app and complication icon artwork was
  generated without reference images and is distributed under GPL-3.0-only. Its creation is
  documented in ../docs/branding.md and its replacement hashes in ../docs/branding/icon.json.
- The Watch app links libwebp (BSD-3-Clause, with Google's WebM patent grant), built from
  https://github.com/SDWebImage/libwebp-Xcode at revision
  2b5256c29ff4e20f2a0d5ee863b62b1a22144434, to decode WebP avatar images when the system
  decoder cannot. Package.swift and the project file pin that revision. The license and
  patent texts are in ../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
- This NOTICE.
All other files are byte-identical to that commit. Distributed under the same
